# X_Bot.glb is a build artifact — derived from source/Pro Sword and
# Shield Pack/X Bot.fbx by FBX2glTF (with --compute-normals missing).
# Don't commit it; the build regenerates it from the FBX on every
# fresh checkout. The FBX is the authoring source.
X_Bot.glb

# .ozz files are derived from X_Bot.glb at build time by the gltf2ozz
# tool (vendored via ozz-animation). Don't commit — they regenerate on
# every fresh checkout.
*.ozz

# `source/` holds raw FBX authoring assets — Mixamo packs and the X Bot
# character itself. The build reads from here; we don't commit the
# heavyweight .fbx files (anyone can re-download from Mixamo).
source/
